# Cluster bootstrapped on fresh install. Users can still switch at runtime via
# the navbar cluster switcher; this is just the default.
VITE_SOLANA_CLUSTER=devnet

# Optional per-cluster RPC overrides. If omitted:
#   devnet / mainnet-beta  → @solana/web3.js clusterApiUrl()
#   localnet               → http://localhost:8899
VITE_RPC_URL_DEVNET=https://api.devnet.solana.com
# VITE_RPC_URL_MAINNET=https://api.mainnet-beta.solana.com
# VITE_RPC_URL_LOCALNET=http://localhost:8899

# settlement-engine Anchor program (same id on devnet + localnet).
# OPTIONAL — defaults to the `address` field of the committed IDL
# (src/chain/idl/settlement_engine.json); set only to override.
# VITE_SETTLEMENT_PROGRAM_ID=7wrjbU1NbVtUCUGP1obi3aiT6QrjXZnH5XJDXMsKtkPG

# USDC mint on the selected cluster.
# OPTIONAL — defaults to devnet USDC 4zMMC9srt5Ri5X14GAgXhaHii3GnPAEERYPJgZJDncDU;
# set only to override (e.g. a localnet test mint or mainnet USDC).
# VITE_USDC_MINT=4zMMC9srt5Ri5X14GAgXhaHii3GnPAEERYPJgZJDncDU

# liquidity-guard upstreams — one per cluster. These are consumed ONLY by the
# Vite dev proxy (vite.config.ts), which exposes them same-origin under
# /liquidity-guard/<cluster>/* (the service sets no CORS headers). The client
# never reads these directly. All three are OPTIONAL — sensible defaults are
# baked into vite.config.ts; uncomment to override.
#
# VITE_LG_URL_LOCALNET=http://localhost:8080
# VITE_LG_URL_DEVNET=https://liquidity-guard-devnet-e1779e87cf84.herokuapp.com
# VITE_LG_URL_MAINNET=https://liquidity-guard-mainnet-162b828790cf.herokuapp.com
#
# Note: the ed25519 attestation pubkey is NOT in env. Source of truth is
# Config.liquidity_guard on-chain (read via useConfigAccount); /health
# service_pubkey is cross-checked against it for drift.
